WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,160
Look at the tree trunk. The tree trunk is edible.

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,210
Which of you has upgraded your cabin?

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,490
I heard there are rewards for upgrading the cabin.

4
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:09,090
Oh my god, look at the trees.

5
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:10,410
I have so many cavemen

6
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:11,850
If you don’t upgrade, wait until the protector passes.

7
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:12,850
I'm dying

8
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:15,290
Forget it, most of them have no nutrition.

9
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:17,050
Go out and touch the box

10
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,920
Senior, today the marking points of the two boxes are still very far apart.

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,600
We have already touched the surrounding area

12
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,720
Only the boxes marked a few days ago are left untouched.

13
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,440
Okay. Then go and touch it.

14
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:34,340
Anyway, my career in the forest is very good now. If there is danger, how far can I run away?

15
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:36,020
More than a thousand meters, senior

16
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:40,630
We'll be there in ten minutes. Be careful.

17
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:43,250
I always feel like this forest is a little strange
